<title>USA: Questar unit to redeem preferred shares.</title>
<headline>Questar unit to redeem preferred shares.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Questar Corp's Mountain Fuel Supply Co subsidiary said it will redeem its eight percent series of preferred stock on July 1 at a redemption price equal to 101 percent of the principal amount.</p>
<p>Questar is an energy-services company with 1.8 billion in assets.</p>
<p>Mountain Fuel is a retail gas-distribution utility in Utah, Wyoming and Idaho.</p>
